0000 - cctns,36,Placing title information consistently: Page titles should be placed in a consistent location on the different pages.,"[{""claim_id"": ""36-C1"", ""claim"": ""Placing title information consistently: Page titles should be placed in a consistent location on the different pages."", ""claim_text"": ""Placing title information consistently: Page titles should be placed in a consistent location on the different pages."", ""claim_kind"": ""OBSERVABLE_CORE"", ""claim_type"": ""OBSERVABLE"", ""importance"": ""CORE"", ""status"": ""MISSING"", ""source"": ""requirement_decomposition""}]",NFR,PARTIALLY_UI_VERIFIABLE,NONE,LAYOUT_POSITION,MEDIUM,"Title placement can be compared across pages, though only for the shown subset."
0000 - cctns,37,"Observing principles of human perception When designing application pages, the general principles of human perception should be taken into account. The International Standards mentioned below shall be consulted for guidance. Practical guidelines for presenting information to the user are to be found in ISO 9241-12. Guidance on selecting and using different forms of interaction techniques is to be found in ISO 9241-14 to ISO 9241-17. ISO 9241-14 gives guidance about menus, ISO 9241-15 about command dialogues, ISO 9241-16 about direct manipulation and ISO 9241-17 about forms. In addition, when designing multimedia information presentations, the design principles and recommendations described in ISO 14915-1 to ISO 14915-3 should be taken into account. Appropriate content presentation also plays a key role in accessibility.","[{""claim_id"": ""37-C1"", ""claim"": ""When designing application pages, the general principles of human perception should be taken into account."", ""claim_text"": ""When designing application pages, the general principles of human perception should be taken into account."", ""claim_kind"": ""OBSERVABLE_CORE"", ""claim_type"": ""OBSERVABLE"", ""importance"": ""CORE"", ""status"": ""MISSING"", ""source"": ""requirement_decomposition""}, {""claim_id"": ""37-C2"", ""claim"": ""The International Standards mentioned below shall be consulted for guidance."", ""claim_text"": ""The International Standards mentioned below shall be consulted for guidance."", ""claim_kind"": ""OBSERVABLE_CORE"", ""claim_type"": ""OBSERVABLE"", ""importance"": ""CORE"", ""status"": ""MISSING"", ""source"": ""requirement_decomposition""}, {""claim_id"": ""37-C3"", ""claim"": ""Practical guidelines for presenting information to the user are to be found in ISO 9241-12."", ""claim_text"": ""Practical guidelines for presenting information to the user are to be found in ISO 9241-12."", ""claim_kind"": ""OBSERVABLE_CORE"", ""claim_type"": ""OBSERVABLE"", ""importan